Hello, got last rt84 from Retevis yesterday - installed, works as expected with no problem. Some findings:<br>- as it has the same chip like rt3s, md380 - scan speed is much slower than on gd77/baofeng 1801<br>- the RX signal recieve is almost or maybe the same like baofeng 1801, good point<br>- more robust, heavier and bigger than rt3s or baofeng 1801<br><br>so in general it's mixture of rt3s and baofeng 1801 with some advantages and disadvantages, the biggest for me is still scan speed.<br><br>Thank you for your work<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2305">S58SMS</a> — Tue Apr 04, 2023 5:39 am</p><hr />
